  "prefLabel": "Agr 1101.10 Product grade",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 1101.10 “Product grade” means the shorthand representation of the minimum guarantee of available nutrient content expressed in terms of total nitrogen, available phosphate, and soluble potash with each guarantee separated by a hyphen. For example, 19-19-19.\n\nSource. #10464, eff 11-26-13, EXPIRED: 11-26-23\n\nNew. #13947, INTERIM, eff 4-30-24, EXPIRED: 10-27-24\n\nNew. #14128, eff 11-26-24, EXPIRES: 11-26-34",
